Here is the root cause:
The bug was caused by quantifiers being incorrectly treated as application terms in the Z3 solver, leading to incorrect behavior when processing logical formulas. This misclassification affected the handling of quantifiers in methods that were designed to work only with application terms, resulting in potential errors during formula manipulation and evaluation.

